{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/areej-apartments-arada-properties-muwaileh-commercial","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":725,"crm_id":"1573","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Areej Apartments","slug":"areej-apartments-arada-properties-muwaileh-commercial","display_address":"Muwaileh Commercial","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Arada Properties","price":799000,"display_price":"799K","lattitude":25.3166085,"longitude":55.4778473,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Areej Apartments is a 7-storey residential complex that is part of the Aljada project located in Sharjah's central Naseej District. The community is being constructed by Arada Developments LLC. Its surroundings include commercial, educational and entertainment facilities in addition to a variety of residential units. The project offers studios and apartments with <strong>1-2 bedrooms</strong>, with full finishes and panoramic windows overlooking the park or boulevard. All units are connected to the \"smart home\" system. Residents of the complex can take advantage of a wide range of amenities. The infrastructure of the complex includes: a common swimming pool, a common hall with sports facilities, cycling and jogging paths, barbecue area, car parking, 24-hour video surveillance. There are cafes, restaurants and stores, kindergartens, schools and nurseries within walking distance. Also in walking distance are Al Zahia Park and Madar Aljada. Al Montazah Parks water park or Rolla Square Park is 20 minutes away. Aljada Community, where the complex is located, is at the intersection of Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Al Dhaid Road. The former is a 20-minute drive to Dubai, while the latter takes you to the beach and Al Majaz Waterfront in the same amount of time. Areej Apartments has direct access to Airport Road, which is easily connected to Sharjah International Airport. It takes only about 15 minutes to reach Dubai International Airport.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1573/images/2024/04/02/ObYv4kbUkU7loVBsG4eHhezQXnKP7imHbyn1GHUS.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/02/ObYv4kbUkU7loVBsG4eHhezQXnKP7imHbyn1GHUS.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1573/images/2024/04/02/b2VKlGLs44cR4unfuoLwgtbGZ1T3NkOmLlMAwIt9.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/02/b2VKlGLs44cR4unfuoLwgtbGZ1T3NkOmLlMAwIt9.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1573/images/2024/04/02/ICu9AxQ2vhzftMvOx5Q9GMG1SZ9XSkn36UttRSaF.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/02/ICu9AxQ2vhzftMvOx5Q9GMG1SZ9XSkn36UttRSaF.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1558,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":826,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1362,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"743 ft²","media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"TBA","payment_plans":[],"community":"","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":6656,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":6657,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":6658,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":6659,"url":null,"text":"Shared SPA","type":null,"image":null},{"id":6660,"url":null,"text":"Shared gym & fitness","type":null,"image":null},{"id":6661,"url":null,"text":"Leisure areas","type":null,"image":null},{"id":6662,"url":null,"text":"Dining outlets  (coffee houses & restaurants)","type":nu